WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.442
Dakedo ki ni naru

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.554
Kinou yori mo zutto...

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:21.187
Togireta yume. ..

00:00:21.326 --> 00:00:24.818
Futari no tsuzukiga shiritai!

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.402
Ah, kami—sama...
jikan o... tomete yo

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:43.006
Kyou kasho...seifuku...
mada kami, kawakanai...

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, tasukete...
ribbon ga kimaranai...

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
Aitsu no yume mita sei... yo

00:00:57.496 --> 00:01:01.296
Koge—kake no toast kajitara...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
Naze ka fui ni...
mune ga tokimeita...

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.579
Amakute nigai. . .marmalade

00:01:15.714 --> 00:01:18.148
Dakara ki ni naru...

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Konna kimochi wa naze?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Ima ichiban...

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:28.951
Aitsu no egao ni aitai!

00:03:00.419 --> 00:03:07.985
A COUPLE'S PROBLEMS —
"I WANT TO HEAR YOUR VOICE."

00:09:50.595 --> 00:09:53.155
SHIN KOKIN WAKASHU

00:11:10.008 --> 00:11:12.101
MARMALADE BOY

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.378
MARMALADE BOY

00:16:48.846 --> 00:16:51.337
I LOVE YUU

00:22:11.402 --> 00:22:12.369
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:33.858 --> 00:22:36.827
FIRM DECISION —
"I'M TAKING MIKI
AWAY FROM YOU."

00:22:53.878 --> 00:22:58.406
Kokoro ga arawareru

00:22:58.549 --> 00:23:03.782
Hikari wo mitsuketa

00:23:03.921 --> 00:23:08.517
Mezamete iku sora ni

00:23:08.659 --> 00:23:14.120
Anata ga kagayaku no

00:23:14.265 --> 00:23:19.202
Donna ni tooku

00:23:19.336 --> 00:23:24.296
Hanarete ite mo

00:23:24.441 --> 00:23:29.310
Onnaji yoake wo

00:23:29.446 --> 00:23:34.816
Mukaete iru no ne

00:23:34.952 --> 00:23:39.582
Mabushiku kirameku no

00:23:39.723 --> 00:23:45.025
Omoide wo musubu ito

00:23:45.162 --> 00:23:50.225
Mirai no mirai ni mo

00:23:50.367 --> 00:23:55.395
Kamisama ga itekureru

00:23:55.539 --> 00:24:01.808
